# NDA originals — never commit these.
# Only the baked-blur copies under public/images/work/covers/nda/ are public.
# NOTE: because this is ignored, the originals are NOT uploaded to Vercel by a
# git deploy. To serve them in production either make this repo private and
# remove this line, or keep the originals in private storage (Vercel Blob/S3)
# and fetch them in src/app/api/nda/[slug]/image/route.ts.
/private

